  "goodToKnow": "Kastrieren means to castrate or neuter: einen Kater, Hund, Hengst kastrieren. Many German cities have a Katzenschutzverordnung requiring outdoor cats to be neutered, chipped and registered to limit stray populations. Figuratively, eine kastrierte Version is a watered-down one. Die Kastration is castration. Perfect without ge-: hat kastriert."
